# DAG: CLEAN IMRPhenomD-injection nested-sampling confirmation for the
# exact-GP+XAS representation (ls_min_q=0.06 baseline, NO log-det fix stack).
#
# Goal: confirm in a full NS posterior what the local fixed-tc profile scans
# already showed (memory exact_xas_no_logdet_bias) -- that exact-GP+XAS has no
# with-K/log-det PE bias at q=0.50/0.60/0.80, where the phase-amplitude
# representation at identical hyperparameters was -3sigma/-15sigma biased.
#
# 12 jobs = {q=0.50,0.60,0.80} x {with-K, no-K} x {SNR~300 (distance=100),
# SNR~20 (distance=1500, realistic-event loudness -- GW150914 was ~24)},
# IMRPhenomD injected, single wide prior [0.15,0.97], nlive=250. The two SNR
# arms together test whether the (absent) log-det bias stays absent as K/C
# shrinks ~SNR^2, and whether any realistic-SNR failure mode appears now that
# the luminosity_distance bug is fixed (memory snr100_universal_attractor).
#
# PREREQUISITES (do on wiay before submitting):
#   1. git pull / rsync so scripts/injection_nested_sampling.py has the
#      luminosity_distance fix (no-op at distance=100 used here, but keep in sync).
#   2. Ensure checkpoints/phenomd_nonspinning_dense30_exact_xas_lsminq006.pt
#      exists at /scratch/wiay/daniel/heron-dense45/checkpoints/. If absent,
#      build it first:  condor_submit condor/train_exact_xas_lsminq006.sub
#      (then wait for completion before submitting this DAG).
#
# Submit from /scratch/wiay/daniel/heron-dense45 on wiay:
#   condor_submit_dag condor/dag_exact_xas_dinj.dag
# Monitor: condor_q daniel -all ; tail -f condor/dag_exact_xas_dinj.dag.dagman.out
# Results land in results/injection_ns_exact_xas_lsminq006_dinj_q0{50,60,80}_{withK,noK}.{npz,png}
#
# Compare each with-K median against its no-K counterpart AND inspect the
# posterior histograms (not just median+CI -- see the bimodality lesson in
# CLAUDE.md / memory lsmin015_q05_retest).

# --- SNR~300 arm (distance=100) ---
JOB DINJ_WITHK condor/exact_xas_lsminq006_dinj_withK.sub
JOB DINJ_NOK   condor/exact_xas_lsminq006_dinj_noK.sub
# --- realistic SNR~20 arm (distance=1500) ---
JOB DINJ_SNR20_WITHK condor/exact_xas_lsminq006_dinj_snr20_withK.sub
JOB DINJ_SNR20_NOK   condor/exact_xas_lsminq006_dinj_snr20_noK.sub

RETRY DINJ_WITHK 1
RETRY DINJ_NOK 1
RETRY DINJ_SNR20_WITHK 1
RETRY DINJ_SNR20_NOK 1
